Looking at the sequence: after pouring the last of the green beans into the bowl on the scale (around 05:25–05:33), the camera wearer sets the empty bag down on the main worktop — on the counter to the left of the cutting board/hob, between the pot/draining rack area (with the red bowl and fruit bowl) and the stove. It stays there through the phone use and the trip to the fridge, and no other bag location is shown after that.

So the bag of green beans was last placed on the counter between the draining rack and the hob.

