Looking at the video, the camera wearer takes the large dark baking tray out of the oven around the 27-30 second mark. They then carry it over and set it down on the counter area to the left of the hob, in the space between the sink's draining rack and the stovetop. For the remainder of the video, the tray stays in that spot (visible in later frames, e.g., around 300s and 650s, with a plate resting on it), and it is never returned to the oven or placed on any burner.

Therefore, the last place the large dark baking tray was put is the counter between the draining rack and the hob.

